{"kind":"request","text":"PD-6, artroom-scope end date and live start setting (tech-debt review 72a6df7d, finding TD-13)\n\nSource: notes/2026-10-25-codebase-techdebt-review.md on Main c8c96843, decision PD-6. The repository cannot reproduce the live artroom-scope settings, and retained Start requests have no end date.\n\nFacts read on 25 October: artroom-scope runs version f85a084e (deployed 23 October). Its nonsecret settings are the file's six variables plus DEMO_START_CONFIG (v 2, register@8, deployment artroom-scope-demo-2026-10-07, register inc in_dsfqvkghobbf4jkjqkcptkycua). ARTIFACTS_CONFIG and DEPLOYMENT are secret bindings there, with SESSION_SECRET and the three GitHub secrets. The metrics dataset holds no creation event for that deployment in the 14 days to 25 October (query by script).\n\nRuling: retained Start requests on artroom-scope end on 8 November 2026. On that date the planner deploys the file without DEMO_START_CONFIG, deletes GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY, GITHUB_CREATION_TOKEN and GITHUB_READ_TOKEN from the Worker, and records the versions in docs/deploy.md. The secrets stay until then because the retained GitHub destinations read them. BR-11 removes the legacy creation code after the date.\n\nWork: one planner head. apps/room/wrangler.jsonc carries the live DEMO_START_CONFIG value and a header that names the end date; packages/cli/test/demo-config.test.ts checks that value and that the file holds no secret-only name; docs/deploy.md records the date and the deletions due then; docs/self-host.md tells self-hosters to remove the line; the review note records the ruling and adds BR-2 to its landed slices.\n\nAcceptance: the DEMO_START_CONFIG string in the file equals the live binding text byte for byte (checker reads the version with wrangler versions view f85a084e-271b-41b6-97c7-30318aa73eb6 --name artroom-scope --json, or trusts the planner's capture in the review text); the config test, the settings and entry-point checks and the gate pass at the reviewed head; one checker review at the exact head before landing. No deployment in this head: the file's value equals the live one, so the next artroom-scope deploy changes nothing.","body":{"conditions":"One planner head; the committed DEMO_START_CONFIG equals the live artroom-scope binding text; config test, settings and entry-point checks and the gate pass at the reviewed head; one checker review at the exact head before landing; no deployment.","target":"inherit","to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}